 *
 * This component provides symbol search functionality for the Minotaur editor.
 * It allows users to search for symbols across the codebase.
 *
 * Usage:
 * <SymbolSearch OnSymbolSelected="HandleSymbolSelected" />
 *
 * Features:
 * - Global symbol search
 * - Type-aware filtering
 * - Scope-aware search
 * - Symbol preview
 * - Go-to-definition
 * - Find all references
 * - Keyboard shortcuts
 *
 * Dependencies:
 * - Minotaur.Core.Services.Editor.SymbolSearchService
 * - Minotaur.Core.Models.Editor.SymbolSearchModels
